  "portable_adaptations": [
    "Repository-relative imports and fixture/helper paths.",
    "ORCA_STATE_DIR, ORCA_MODEL_ROOT, and ORCA_CACHE_ROOT replace machine-specific filesystem roots.",
    "Fresh snapshot validation receipts are generated under ORCA_STATE_DIR and are never sourced from historical evidence.",
    "The corrected runtime image is selected through BATTERY_IMAGE, resolved to an immutable local image ID, and never replaced with an unpatched fallback.",
