    "Prepared fidelity metadata had only machine-local descriptive paths normalized; token IDs, token hashes, sampling, panels, and budgets are unchanged.",
    "The shared production-safety coordinator accepts only caller-installed packaged phase plans; stale defaults that referenced unimported field-lab scripts were removed without changing drain, isolation, cleanup, or restoration logic.",
    "The R38 collision client changes only prefill_compute_share and prefill_compute_half_life, verifies application, and restores both mutable fields; obsolete micro-slicing fields are removed.",
    "The portable collision/cache/soak campaign was exercised end to end in operations-01, including verified restoration after failed gates.",
    "After the frozen run, the SVG renderer was corrected to compare rates across completion-bounded cells; original raw plots are retained.",
    "Runtime-repair modules carry explicit modification notices; their executable Python ASTs remain identical to the tested copies.",
    "The evidence exporter preserves zero-byte HTTP request-body artifacts regardless of the .json suffix; a real rejected GET-body receipt is covered by the round-trip regression.",
    "Extensionless ELF files under the extracted vendor runtime tree follow the existing vendor-binary exclusion policy. The actual vllm-rs file matches the pinned runtime byte-for-byte.",
    "The --cache-root prefix is normalized in ordinary text as well as structured fields, with an end-to-end restore regression.",
    "The result generator also publishes all 32 client prefill scouts and 36 guarded speculative counter cells without making new model requests.",
    "One manually reviewed, exact synthetic narrative literal is allowed during export so all twenty Estonia diagnostic artifacts retain their original bytes. This does not authorize other credentials in the same file."
